ters Our north star is simple yet ambitious: No one should be surprised by a natural disaster. L228: \nL229: cite61†Research@ 2026: Novel capabilities and intelligence L230: \nL231: cite62†Ask a Scientist: How are researchers using AI to help pregnant women access ultrasounds? L232: \nL233: cite63†View more from Google Research L234: ## Developers\nL235: \nL236: cite64†Gemini 4 Argon is now available for developers. L237: \nL238: cite65†Build real-time voice applications with Gemini 3.8 Live and 3.5 Transcribe L239: \nL240: cite66†DevFest 2026: Come Build with Us L241: \nL242: cite8†View more from Developer tools L243: \nL244: ## All the Latest\nL245: \nL246:   * Privacy\nL247:   * Terms\nL248:   * Help\nL249:   * [Select]\nL250: \nL251:   * [Select]\n"
